  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be retained in accordance with the following approved plans:\rPC/2025/007 REV A\rPC/2025/002 REV A\rPC/2025/001 REV A\rPC/2025/003 REV A\rPC/2025/004 REV A\rPC/2025/005 REV A\rPC/2016/002 \rPC/2016/005\rLocation Plan\rDesign Access Statement\rPlanning Statement\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 6 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. The existing outbuilding at the rear shall only be used as storage area in connection with the HMO and shall not be used as a separate unit.\r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within 3 months from the date of this decision notice a fire resisting door at the entrance to the communal kitchen /dining room shall be fitted/provided as required by the standards of the Council. Such facilities to be retained permanently thereafter. \rReason: In the interests of the safety of future occupiers.\r"
  ],
